---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import FinancialClusterNav from '../components/FinancialClusterNav.astro';

const title = 'Portugal HQA Visa Cost - Fees and Professional Spend';
const metaTitle = `${title} | Portugal HQA Residency`;
const metaDescription =
  'Portugal HQA visa cost in 2026 is state fees plus translations and counsel, not a Golden Visa subscription. See the fee groups before you file the pack.';
---

<Layout title={metaTitle} description={metaDescription}>
  <article>
    <header class="bg-background">
      <div class="site-container py-24 md:py-32">
        <Breadcrumb
          items={[
            { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
            { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa', label: 'Portugal HQA Visa' },
            { label: 'Cost' },
          ]}
        />
        <h1 class="mt-8 max-w-4xl">{title}</h1>
        <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl">
          Portugal HQA visa cost is the cash spent to prepare and lodge a highly qualified activity file: state fees, legalization, translations, travel for biometrics, and any professional work you instruct. It is not a capital subscription. Confirm 2026 euro amounts on the AIMA and consular tables in force for the office that will see the file. Who must qualify sits upstream on
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-requirements" class="inline-link">HQA visa requirements</a>.
          Lodging sits downstream on the
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-application" class="inline-link">HQA visa application</a>
          page. How long that lodging then takes is
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-processing-time" class="inline-link">HQA visa processing time</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-background-alt">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl py-24 md:py-32">
        <section>
          <h2>State fees and card fees</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Expect a consular visa fee when the person applies from abroad, then residence-permit and card-issuance fees when AIMA (or the successor desk named on the current form) produces the card. Repeat fees appear at renewal. Posts publish their own tables. Do not copy a euro figure from an old blog post into a 2026 budget.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>Documents, travel, and counsel</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Apostilles or legalizations, certified Portuguese translations, criminal-record certificates, and courier costs sit outside the state tariff. If the person must travel for biometrics, add fares and lodging. If you instruct an
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-lawyer" class="inline-link">HQA visa lawyer or consultant</a>,
            their invoice is a professional fee, not a government charge. Family members added to the same move multiply several of these lines.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>What is not a filing fee</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            A salary at or above a published highly qualified floor is a pay condition, not a fee paid to the state. There is no Golden Visa-style fund or real-estate ticket on this route. That distinction is the whole of the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-investment" class="inline-link">HQA visa investment</a>
            page. Tax that may arise after you live in Portugal is not a visa fee either; see
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-tax" class="inline-link">HQA visa tax</a>.
            The program map remains the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa" class="inline-link">Portugal HQA visa</a>
            guide.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
          <a
            href="/portugal-hqa-visa-investment"
            class="card cluster-card flex h-full flex-col p-8 transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-[5px] hover:border-brand hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(28,25,23,0.10)]"
          >
            <h3>Investment and capital</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 flex-1">
              Why this route has no capital subscription, and how salary and subsistence differ from a Golden Visa ticket.
            </p>
            <span class="btn-primary mt-8 w-full gap-2">
              Open the investment page
              <span class="cluster-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/portugal-hqa-visa-tax"
            class="card cluster-card flex h-full flex-col p-8 transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-[5px] hover:border-brand hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(28,25,23,0.10)]"
          >
            <h3>Tax after you reside</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 flex-1">
              When Portuguese tax residency can attach, and why that question belongs with a tax professional, not the fee table.
            </p>
            <span class="btn-primary mt-8 w-full gap-2">
              Open the tax page
              <span class="cluster-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <FinancialClusterNav current="/portugal-hqa-visa-cost" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-cta-tint">
      <div class="site-container flex flex-col items-start gap-6 py-24 md:py-32">
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl">Build a 2026 fee budget against the post that will read the file</h2>
        <p class="max-w-2xl">
          This page is informational. It is not legal, tax, or immigration advice. Fee tables change. An advisor can map state charges and professional work to your host and your consulate.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-cta">Discuss a realistic cost range for this file</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
